constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2880630264[] = _("Creates Extremely Harsh\nSunlight lasting until user\nswitches. Nullifies all damaging\nWater moves. Fire moves gain 50%\nboost. Cannot be overridden\nexcept by other primal weather.\nActivates extra effects on sun\nrelated moves. Sets up a 3-turn\nTailwind on entry. Doubles the\nSpeed of all allies.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_16265484[] = _("Boosts Speed by +2 stages when\nhit by Rock-type moves or when\nswitching in with Stealth Rock\npresent. Also, absorbs any Rock-\ntype or Stealth Rock damage and\nheals for 25% of their max HP.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1826827515[] = _("The user gains immunity to Fire-\ntype moves and they heal for 25%\nof their max HP when hit by them.\nAlways burn with moves that can\nactivate them.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1162538378[] = _("Absorbs Rock-type attacks and\nStealth Rocks, taking no damage\nand boosting speed by +2\ninstead.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_597145668[] = _("Boosts the user's Special Attack\nstat by 50%. Multiplicative with\nother damage boosts. Sets up\nAurora Veil on entry, cutting\nphysical and special damage\nrecieved by half for your allies.\nLasts 5 turns, or 8 turns with\nLight Clay. Immune to Hail\ndamage.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1327209649[] = _("All non-Ice-types lose 1/8 of\ntheir max HP at the end of each\nturn. Restores 1/8 max HP to Ice-\ntypes at the end of each turn.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_832536038[] = _("Heals the user for 1/8 of all\ndamage they deal to opponents.\nHealing occurs immediately after\ndamage is dealt. Minimum healing\nof 1 HP.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_3184341853[] = _("Eats one of the following\nberries at end of turn: Sitrus,\nLiechi, Ganlon, Salac, Petaya,\nApicot, Lansat, Starf, or a\nrandom pinch healing berry.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_3896688089[] = _("When the user switches in during\na double battle, it heals its ally\nfor 25% of their max HP.\nAdditionally, the user's ally\nreceives 25% less damage in\ndouble battles. Multiplicative\nwith other damage reduction\nsources.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1003529233[] = _("All allies become immune to\nstatus conditions and secondary\neffects from enemy moves while\nsand is active. Restores 1/16 of\nthe Pokemon's maximum HP at the\nend of each turn.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2615906462[] = _("Boosts the user's Special Attack\nby one stage whenever it knocks\nout an opponent with a direct\nhit. Attack 2-3 times per move\nbased on number of heads. 1.25x\ntotal for 2 heads, 1.35x total\nfor 3 heads.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_3136742777[] = _("Landing contact moves causes\nthe target to always move last\nregardless of priority, speed, or\nother effects for 5 turns.\nEffect does not stack or refresh\non already afflicted targets.\nTrapping moves last 6 turns\ninstead of 4-5 turns and\nincreases their damage at the\nend of the turn to 1/6 max HP per\nturn.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_3257276431[] = _("Sets either Grassy or Psychic\nTerrain on entry with a 50%\nchance for either. Holding a\nGrassy Seed will guarantee\nGrassy Terrain while holding a\nPsychic Seed will guarantee\nPsychic Terrain.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2226990202[] = _("Boosts Attack and Defense when\nthe user or their ally's stats\nare lowered. Reduces damage from\nsuper-effective attacks by 35%.\nMultiplicative with other\nsources of damage reduction.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1827045346[] = _("Has a 50% chance to trap the foe\nwhen making contact, on either\noffense or defense, as if by the\nmove Snap Trap. If the user is\nswitching in or gained the\nability this turn, such as by\nmega evolving, the chance is\nincreased to 100%.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2817910065[] = _("The user's Ice-type moves apply\nthe Ice Statue status to the\ntarget, making them Ice-type\nwith no resistances or frostbite\nimmunity. If Ice Statue is\napplied the user switches.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_30309085[] = _("Takes 15% less damage from all\nattacks. Takes 30% less damage\nfrom resisted attacks.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2625863962[] = _("The first Electric Move will\ndouble in damage, but once used\nwill lose its Electric typing.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2559727406[] = _("Boosts Attack stat by +1 after\nusing a move that causes recoil\ndamage. Takes 1/2 recoil damage.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_3506265930[] = _("Keen Edge attacks deal 1.3x\ndamage and become special moves,\nusing Special Attack and hitting\nSpecial Defense. They also lower\nthe target's Special Defense by\n1 stage (max once per turn per\ntarget).");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_888528248[] = _("Sets Defense to +6 when it\nenters. After it is hit lowers\nits Defense by 1 stage. Multi-hit\nattacks lower Defense multiple\ntimes.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_3818004611[] = _("Lowers the SpAtk of foes by 2\nstages on entry. Changes the\nuser's Normal-type moves to\nDark-type. If the user is Dark-\ntype its Dark-type moves have a\n10% enrage chance, otherwise it\ngains Dark STAB.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1135688522[] = _("Increases the user's Special\nDefense by 50% while affected by\nhail. This increase applies to all\neffects that scale with Defense.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_3698998287[] = _("Jungle Fever boosts the\nPokemon's Speed by 50% when\nGrassy Terrain is active. The\nboost applies immediately and\ndisappears when it ends.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1893847604[] = _("Creates Grassy Terrain for 8\nturns (12 with Terrain Extender)\non entry. Moves bypass the\neffects of screens, Safeguard,\nMist, and Substitute.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1196377910[] = _("The user's Normal-type moves\nbecome Bug-type. If the user is\nBug-type it is immune to powder\nmoves, otherwise it gains Bug\nSTAB. Boosts the power of all\nwing, wind, and air-based moves\nby 30%.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_635928569[] = _("Adds 20% of the user's Defense\nstat to attack calculations for\ncontact moves. Prevents\nparalysis, immediately curing it\nif inflicted on the user. Summons\na sandstorm for 8 turns (12 with\nSmooth Rock) on entry. Immune to\nsandstorm damage.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1321080951[] = _("All attacks hit twice in\nsuccession. The first hit deals\n100%, while the second hit deals\n50%. Each hit rolls secondary\neffects independently (except\nflinch). Bypasses Fort\nKnox/Wonder Skin.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_617433955[] = _("Moves used by the user act as if\nthe weather is harsh sunlight.\nCreates Grassy Terrain for 8\nturns (12 with Terrain Extender)\non entry.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_480018684[] = _("Immune to status. Halves damage\ntaken from Poison-type attacks\nand contact moves, but doubles\ndamage taken from Water-type\nattacks.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1377554214[] = _("When the user is hit by any\ndamaging move, the attacker will\nbecome burned.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_3028615795[] = _("30% chance to inflict bleeding on\ncontact moves, both when\nattacking and being attacked.\nBoosts the power of horn and\ndrill-based attacks by 30%.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_580487701[] = _("The user's physical attacks deal\n30% increased damage while\nPsychic Terrain is active. Works\neven if the user is grounded.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_3976482504[] = _("Negates the opponent's ability\nand innates when the user\nsuccessfully inflicts bleed on\nthem. Suppression wears off\nafter they switch out.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2942421947[] = _("The user's Electric-type moves\nhit Ground types for not very\neffective damage instead of no\neffect, and hit Electric types\nfor super effective damage\ninstead of not very effective.\nThe user can paralyze Electric\ntypes.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1731660297[] = _("The user only takes damage from\ndirect attacks, ignoring all\nfield effects such as weather,\nrooms, or terrains, and always\nsurvives an attack that would\nknock it out with 1 HP remaining,\nas long as it was at full HP.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_1829011470[] = _("The user's Attack and Special\nAttack stats are both doubled,\nand its damaging moves use\nwhichever of Attack or Special\nAttack is higher, regardless of\nthe move's normal category.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_895130774[] = _("All of the user's moves, contact\nor not, use its Speed stat for\ndamage instead of Attack or\nSpecial Attack. When hit by a\nnon-contact move, the user's\nSpeed stat is used defensively\ninstead of Defense or Special\nDefense. Contact damage taken is\nhalved, but Fire-type moves deal\ndouble damage.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2695907429[] = _("Mystique Armament shifts the\nuser to Sword Forme and strikes\nboth opposing Pokemon with the\nmost effective type; Mystic\nAegis returns it to Shield Forme,\nor raises its Defenses if it\nalready is.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2272646036[] = _("Keen Edge (slicing) moves deal\n20% more damage and land boosted\ncritical hits.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_338415578[] = _("Raises Attack by one stage upon\nentering battle and whenever it\nis struck, maximizing it on\ncritical hits. Keen Edge\n(slicing) moves deal 20% more\ndamage, land boosted critical\nhits, never miss, and pierce\nprotection, substitutes, and\nscreens.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_58124612[] = _("Opposing priority moves fail\nagainst the user and its ally.\nPhysical moves deal 20% more\ndamage, and each KO it scores\nraises its Attack and Speed by\none stage. It takes halved Fire\ndamage and can never be\ncritically hit.");
constexpr u8 __sAbilityText_2588536538[] = _("All damage taken is halved. The\nfirst time it falls below half HP\neach time it enters battle, it\nrestores 25% of its max HP. It\neats a random berry at the end\nof each turn (earlier when\nweakened), and its type shifts to\nmatch its own strikes or to\nweather incoming ones.");
